  offerDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences:
    - You've got a <b><#E09500>100-meter</color></b> gap, different road elevations,
      and a heavy vehicle to accommodate.
    - It won't be an easy crossing, but you've handled some challenging projects
      already.
    - Take your time, study the requirements, and build something that works.
    - I trust your judgment, {PlayerName}. If you're ready, take the contract.
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences:
    - <b><#E09500>Pay attention to the shear forces near the supports during testing.
      Remember, the entire bridge needs to remain safe</color></b>.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences:
    - Well done, {PlayerName}. The southern connection is finally open.
    - You've made a real difference here in Rivermere.
    - From here, the road leads toward <b><#E09500>Ironhaven</color></b> in the <b><#E09500>Industrial
      Zone</color></b>.
    - I hear they've got some challenging projects waiting there.
    - Take care out there, and good luck with your next adventure!
